ant for industry leading Android apps\054 including\072\nA \034click and collect\035 grocery pickup app with over 1 million users in Canada\056\nAn at home streaming platform for a popular American fitness brand\056\n\n\nPROJECTS\n\nIris \055 Color Palette for Android \055 g)
